The daggers are nice until you complete the quest and get fast power
regeneration from your quest artifact.  After that I generally put away
my missile weapons since MM, cone of cold, and fireball can do much
more damage (to multiple targets).  Even after you get the AoY, you
really shouldn't be fighting/casting to the point where you run out of
power and need to fall back on missile weapons.  I prefer
AoLS/CoMR/SDSM (plus HoB, GoD, and BoWW, and the jump spell but that's
not germaine to your question).

Is there any reason you're itching to use the wish now?  You can likely
find most of the items you're looking for without a wish (AoLS and BoWW
are guaranteed), and you seem to be doing well enough that the wish
could be saved for a "real need".



